[.intro-text.first,at=144.2]
[.sc]#Suggestions to Teachers#.—Thorough and
frequent drills on the elementary sounds are
useful in correcting vicious habits of pro{shy}nunciation
and in strengthening the vocal
organs.

[.intro-text,at=225.4]
As a rule, only one or two sounds should
be employed at one lesson. Care should be
taken that the pupils observe and practice
these sounds correctly in their reading.

